cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "interactor-healthkit-osc: Apple Watch heart rate to VRChat OSC"
abstract: >
  An iPhone app that reads heart-rate samples from HealthKit and sends them as
  OSC over UDP to VRChat on the local network, cross-built and signed on Linux.
authors:
